# Own the private lifecycle of one ordinary streaming child process.
# Authority: pipes, start, process-group ownership, native exit observation, first-cause
# classification, bounded reader teardown, group cleanup, observer close, the sole cmd.Wait,
# one Done publication, cached Wait, and idempotent cancellation.
# Invariants: the kernel never invokes a shell or sudo; adapters remain deferred; natural exit,
# cancellation, reader failure, observer failure, and cleanup failure have deterministic precedence;
# every successful start joins all workers and reaps exactly once before completion.
# Dependency: closed RK1UO native exit observer commit 19fabd7.
# Deferred: public RunStreaming/RunExactStreaming adapters (RK1ULA), privileged sudo (RK1P).
version=2
slice_id=rk1ulk-private-lifecycle-kernel
state=tests-red
max_total_files=2
max_production_files=1
max_changed_lines=790
ignore=tasks/pi-agent-integration-spec.md
allow=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle.go
allow=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle_test.go
allow=tasks/slice-commit-ledger.tsv
test=internal/runner/streaming_lifecycle_test.go
